# Workflow Work

Execute approved plans in small validated slices.

## Execution Pattern

1. Implement one step at a time.
2. Run the smallest relevant validation after each step.
3. Report progress and blockers quickly.
4. Keep unrelated edits out of the same change set.

## Quality Rules

- Preserve existing behavior unless the plan states otherwise.
- Add clear naming for new interfaces and payload fields.
- Prefer compatibility adapters when changing payload formats.
